Clinical Trials Ordinance (ClinO)
SR 810.305 — Ordinance of 20 September 2013 on Clinical Trials in Human Research (Clinical Trials Ordinance, ClinO).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2013/643]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
English consolidation of 15 August 2025, which is also the date of the current binding text.

:INFO
Preamble
The Swiss Federal Council,
on the basis of the Human Research Act of 30 September 2011 (HRA), of Article 36 paragraphs 1, 3 and 4 of the Transplantation Act of 8 October 2004 (Transplantation Act),and of Article 54 paragraphs 3, 6 and 7 of the Therapeutic Products Act of 15 December 2000 (TPA),
ordains:
|

:NOTE
SR 810.30
SR 810.21
SR 812.21

