2. Approval and Notification Procedures for Clinical Trials of Medicinal Products, Products under Article 2a paragraph 2 TPA and Transplant Products — 33 articles
3. Approval and Notification Procedures for Clinical Trials on the Transplantation of Human Organs, Tissues and Cells — 13 articles
4. Other Clinical Trials — 4 articles
5. Registration and Publication — 2 articles
6. Final Provisions — 7 articles

